('itel-powerpulse-20000-22w', 'itel PowerPulse 20000mAh 22.5W Fast Charge Power Bank - Gradient Blue', 'power', 18500, 17900, 14800, 85, 0.38, '/assets/products/itel-powerpulse-20k-22w.webp', 'Fast-charge your phone at 22.5W with this sleek gradient-design power bank. The 20,000mAh capacity charges a smartphone 4 times, with dual output ports for simultaneous charging. LED battery indicator shows remaining capacity at a glance.', 1, unixepoch('2026-06-16'), 1, 14800, '/assets/products/itel-powerpulse-20k-22w.webp', 16800, 4.5, 1, 'itel', 1, 1),

