('wireless-presenter-laser-pointer', 'Wireless Presentation Clicker with Red Laser Pointer & 100m Range', 'accessories', 9500, 9200, 7200, 70, 0.06, '/assets/products/wireless-presenter-laser.webp', 'Command every presentation with confidence using this professional presenter featuring a bright red laser visible on any screen, 100-meter wireless range, and intuitive touch controls for slide navigation, volume, and screen blackout. Plug-and-play with USB receiver.', 1, unixepoch('2026-06-16'), 1, 7200, '/assets/products/wireless-presenter-laser.webp', 8500, 4.5, 1, 'Generic', 1, 1),

